 trees make it to the grave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/Monument_Gif_Optimized_masked.gif?t=1743943879\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Be a Tree in the City</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb buildings, discover hidden places and enjoy the unusual perspective of an urban environment. The demo offers a first insight into the special game mechanics that give you unimagined freedom and creative fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/Gif2_Masked.gif?t=1743943879\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features of the Demo</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a tree  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw people, cars or not  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a <strong>variety</strong> of <strong>events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet TreesaurusRex?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch squirrels make dirty-mirty ding-dongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climbing houses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more.. way more... </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to tear the city from its roots?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a tree, be, <strong>The Tree</strong>.</p>","developers":["RevampIteration"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/cf7342a20944704babb278f37f97044ab449bf64/header.jpg?t=1743943879","is_f